{
  "name": "Superior Technique",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You learn one maneuver of your choice from among those available to the fighter archetype. If a maneuver you use requires your target to make a Saving Throw to resist the maneuver's effects, the Saving Throw DC equals 8 + your Proficiency bonus + your Strength or Dexterity modifier (your choice).</p><p>You gain one superiority die, which is a d6 (this die is added to any superiority dice you have from another source). This die is used to fuel your maneuvers. A superiority die is expended when you use it. You regain your expended superiority dice when you finish a Short or a Long Rest.</p>",
